    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Measure neural-spine height along reconstructed vertebral columns, calculate local bending moments for standardized postures, and test proportionality within and across species. Alternative models based on muscle leverage should be compared.";
